{
  "id": "JOB.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 11",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then answered Zophar the Naamathite, and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Should not the multitude of words be answered? and should a man full of talk be justified?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Should thy lies make men hold their peace? and when thou mockest, shall no man make thee ashamed?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thou hast said, My doctrine",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pure, and I am clean in thine eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But oh that God would speak, and open his lips against thee;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And that he would shew thee the secrets of wisdom, that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "they are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "double to that which is! Know therefore that God exacteth of thee",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "less",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "than thine iniquity",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "deserveth",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Canst thou by searching find out God? canst thou find out the Almighty unto perfection?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "It is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as high as heaven; what canst thou do? deeper than hell; what canst thou know?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The measure thereof",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "longer than the earth, and broader than the sea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If he cut off, and shut up, or gather together, then who can hinder him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he knoweth vain men: he seeth wickedness also; will he not then consider",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For vain man would be wise, though man be born",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "like",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a wild ass's colt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If thou prepare thine heart, and stretch out thine hands toward him;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If iniquity",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in thine hand, put it far away, and let not wickedness dwell in thy tabernacles.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For then shalt thou lift up thy face without spot; yea, thou shalt be stedfast, and shalt not fear:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because thou shalt forget",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thy",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "misery,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "remember",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as waters",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pass away:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thine",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "age shall be clearer than the noonday; thou shalt shine forth, thou shalt be as the morning.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt be secure, because there is hope; yea, thou shalt dig",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "about thee, and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou shalt take thy rest in safety.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also thou shalt lie down, and none shall make",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thee",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.11.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.11.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "afraid; yea, many shall make suit unto thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the eyes of the wicked shall fail, and they shall not escape, and their hope",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be as",
              "type": "text",
